{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-07",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "妥協する気はないぞ  (No Intention of Compromising)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "driver": "配達員",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting across from the American star and her manager on the island, Muranishi lays out his artistic philosophy through the interpreter—promising an unforgettable film without a shred of compromise. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "お互いにとってタイミングが合ってよかったって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、それは俺も思う。いい演技を頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "世界中の業界に衝撃を与えるつもりだから、妥協する気はないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "彼女も妥協する気はないって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "日本の男優は出ない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何笑ってるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "気にしないで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "脱いでもらう前に、まず君の心を裸にしたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何て？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "そういうのは大丈夫みたい。セクシーに撮影してって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなの当たり前だ。いいか、先に言っとくぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大げさなものは俺は撮らないからな。恥じらいが命だ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "お互いにとってタイミングが合ってよかったって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says she's glad the timing worked out for both of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、それは俺も思う。いい演技を頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, I feel the same way. I'm counting on great acting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "世界中の業界に衝撃を与えるつもりだから、妥協する気はないぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I intend to shock the industry around the world, so I won't compromise.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "彼女も妥協する気はないって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says she has no intention of compromising either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "日本の男優は出ない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No Japanese male actors will appear.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何笑ってるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are they laughing about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "気にしないで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't mind it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "脱いでもらう前に、まず君の心を裸にしたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before you take off your clothes, first I want to bare your heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何て？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did she say?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "そういうのは大丈夫みたい。セクシーに撮影してって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says she's fine without that—just film her looking glamorous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなの当たり前だ。いいか、先に言っとくぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That goes without saying. Listen, let me tell you up front.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大げさなものは俺は撮らないからな。恥じらいが命だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't shoot over-the-top stuff. Subtlety is the soul of it.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
